### 1. Root Check
GET http://localhost:3000/

### 2. Get All Products
GET http://localhost:3000/products

### 3. Filter Products by Search Query (name)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?search=mouse

### 4. Sort Products by Price (Ascending)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?sortBy=price_asc

### 5. Sort Products by Price (Descending)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?sortBy=price_desc

### 6. Get Single Product by ID (Success)
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1

### 7. Get Single Product by ID (Not Found - 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/products/99999

### 8. Add New Product (Success - 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gaming Headset",
  "price": 59.99,
  "quantity": 2
}

### 9. Add New Product (Validation Error - 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -10
}

### 10. Update Product by ID (Success - 200)
PUT http://localhost:3000/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Ergonomic Mouse",
  "price": 29.99,
  "quantity": 4
}

### 11. Delete Product by ID (Success - 200)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/2

### 12. Delete Product by Non-existent ID (404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/99999
